Rule 3 (broadcasting compatibility for x and scale)
{v_1 : tensor, v_3 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) > 0 ∧ ndim(v_3) > 0 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, if ndim(v_1) ≥ ndim(v_3) then ndim(v_1) - 1 else ndim(v_3) - 1] : ndim(v_1) - i - 1 < 0 ∨ ndim(v_3) - i - 1 < 0 ∨ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - i - 1) = 1 ∨ shape(v_3, ndim(v_3) - i - 1) = 1 ∨ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - i - 1) = shape(v_3, ndim(v_3) - i - 1)
